onding changes in TDEE entirely through long-term adaptations in resting metabolic function, independent of the immediate energy cost of the physical activity itself.', 'perplexity': 1.2567841687823833, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8510049144730161, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.12695093677770683, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005248518499676183, 'prob_variance': 0.05402158111046444, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.8978308212897732, 'avg_nll': 0.22855621143052984}

